  "algorithm": "nonredundant_alignment_columns_reciprocal_v1",
  "upstream_review": "CheckV weighted HSP identity can double-weight overlapping bases; its prune_alns depends on alignment order. Local production adapter deterministically clips overlapping alignment columns on both sequences, counts gaps against ANI, takes minimum reciprocal ANI and shorter AF, and defers short bridges before representative selection. Thresholds are percent, inclusive 95/85; policy provisional, source comparisons retained."
